cture and connectivity are not typically adjusted during training; instead, the network learns by adjusting the output weights to map the reservoir's internal state to the desired output.","role":"assistant"},"model":"qwen2.5:7b","prompt_eval_count":1060,"prompt_eval_duration":49438000,"total_duration":1931579400}}